{"entryId":"1813","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1813:1","sourceSha256":"4221b26f371e9bde9019e152b1dde0bb5dc28dc8acfb703e6b31e63ff1f803cc","englishSha256":"5b308e02e1f85794c36df78b75b5461b9ff68dee2f8c4a94dae1e5140d4dd2fe","citations":[],"inlineHebrew":[],"holds":[{"raw":"יוחנן איש ירושלים יוסי בנו","reason":"Avot and Sotah give the son’s name and the place designation in one name formula. Whether the place designation is carried by the father or the son remains open in this short notice.","evidence":[{"reference":"Pirkei Avot 1:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Pirkei_Avot_1.4"},"witness":"Torat Emet 357"},{"reference":"Mishnah Sotah 9:9","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Mishnah_Sotah_9.9"},"witness":"Torat Emet 357"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"Keep the stated son relation. The two Mishnah witnesses attest the name formula and the place name without requiring an editorial decision about its attachment.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Pirkei Avot 1:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Pirkei_Avot_1.4"},"witness":"Torat Emet 357"},{"reference":"Mishnah Sotah 9:9","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Mishnah_Sotah_9.9"},"witness":"Torat Emet 357"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
